# One move of the Connect Four game (phase2/P2-02 §2.3). /brain/drop: the token held at HANDOVER goes into a
# column. /brain/pick: a token is taken at a station of the dispenser and brought to HANDOVER (ADR-041).
# The token's centre in base_link, m: at the release (so101_connect4.board.column_target), or where it waits at
# its station (board.station_target)
geometry_msgs/Point target
---
bool success    # replied at the end of the move, the arm back at HANDOVER
string message  # "done in <s> s"; or no_token, unreachable, not_at_handover, not_idle:<state>, busy, no_joint_states, stopped, timeout:<step>
